        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[The Perl Advent Calendar 2026 CFP Is Open]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Olaf has declared the Call for Papers for the Perl Advent Calendar season 27. The announcement outlines a tight schedule wherein ideas are expected by October 15 and final drafts by November 1. The announcement also mentioned healthy community-first policy focused on the voice of the author rather than that of large language model generators.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.09.22</pubDate>
