        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[This week in PSC (236) | 2026-09-22]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[This Week in PSC #236, the three members came together to have a discussion about the two proposals having a match case. They came to the conclusion to have mailing list discussions on destructuring ideas. They also made the discussion to advance the PPC proposals for @INC. They also talked about the unification of the core functionalities hooks which include the limitation of the function rand() and installation of random number generators.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.09.22</pubDate>
